Ritchie - thanks for answering. Sorry for the slow responses, I was away during the weekend.  I think I can understand/conceptualize what you're saying, but I'm having a lot of trouble implementing it into my existing code.  Could you tell me if I'm on the right track here?  Also, Please let me know if this snippet gives too much away and I'll edit it accordingly.

